comment.narrative:
The eBus route and depot location selection is in progress.&nbsp; The issuance of bid documents is now rescheduled for April 15, 2024.&nbsp;

This indicator measures the change in GHG emissions due to the introduction of e-buses, compared to the busines as usual using ICE buses. The project expects to reduce the GHG emissions. The baseline is normalized to equal 100% and the target shows the expected reduction against this base.

Status update: The eBus route and depot location selection is in progress.&bsp; The issurance of bid documents is targeted for September 2023.&nbsp; Currently seven potential methodogies have been identified and further disucssion and consultation is needed to decide which methodology is implementatable.&nbsp;
